\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2 A Washington homeless agency is being called out for not giving shelter to the homeless during the bomb cyclone in the state. A homeless woman was killed in an encampment when a tree fell on her tent, but the organization had claimed that the storm didn't 'meet our current activation thresholds' and didn't try to shelter the homeless ahead of the torrent.}
