\ul\cf2 disorder}{\rtlch\af2\alang1025\afs24\ltrch\b0\i0\fs20\lang1033\langnp1033\langfe1033\langfenp1033\loch\af2\dbch\af2\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2  (ADHD), as well as decreased child inhibitory control and cognitive flexibility.}{\rtlch\afs24\ltrch\fs24
